		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7c0587b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="7c0587b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-16287ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="16287ed" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">ABOUT THE CLUB</div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9fa6356 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9fa6356" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Bury Football Club is an English association football club based in Lancashire since its inception in 1885. Two-time FA Cup winners at the turn of the 20th Century, we plied our trade within the English Football League from 1894 until 2019, when financial mismanagement resulted in explusion from the EFL.</p><p>With the club and ground now pieced back together, we are again one and compete in the Northern Premier League, Step 8 of the football pyramid.</p><p>We are the &#8216;Shakers&#8217; and we play at Gigg Lane.</p>								</div>
				</div>
